# This case should get vectorized by means of the LLVM loop vectorizer's
# reduction pattern detection.

# The float reduction adds an alloca that refers to another alloca which has to
# be currently context saved.
# TODO: Recursive rematerialization to fix this.
# CHECK: wi_context

# Let LLVM a lot of freedom to generate the reduction trees. Just make
# sure we do the final reductions using vector instrinsics.
CHECK: call i32 @llvm.vector.reduce.add.
CHECK: call reassoc float @llvm.vector.reduce.fadd.
